WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, you guys,
tomorrow is Thanksgiving.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.837 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Tomorrow.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.573 size:84% position:42%
And I saw that a record
30 million Americans

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.707 size:78% position:39% line:92%
are flying this year.

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, when the airlines
heard that, they were like,

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.078 line:92%
"Yeah, we'll see about that."

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.279 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:13.847 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Around 30, yeah.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
I heard that 50 million people
are traveling by car.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:18.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thanksgiving car rides
are great,

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:21.321
because after fighting with
your extended family all day,

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's nice to get back
to fighting

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.758 line:92%
with your immediate family.

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:26.760 line:92%
You kind of -- You need that.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.762 size:88% position:44%
But Thanksgiving traffic
is already pretty bad.

00:00:28.762 --> 00:00:30.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
Take a look at this footage --
this is real --

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:32.165 line:92%
from Los Angeles last night.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.233 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at that.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.403
I mean, those people aren't
going home for Thanksgiving.

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're going home
for Christmas.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.273 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What?

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.174 line:92%
-Well, after Thanksgiving,

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.843 align:start size:94% position:6%
the holiday shopping season
officially begins.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's when everyone
has to decide,

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
do I want to get trampled
on Black Friday

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
or have my identity stolen
on Cyber Monday?

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:51.885 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
Black Friday's coming up.

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
And lots of stores are running
special promotions

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:56.589 size:78% position:39% line:92%
to attract customers.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.992
And some of them unveiled
a slogan for that big day.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.928
I'll show you what I mean here.
For example, there's Best Buy.

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:04.898
Their slogan is, "Give us
your emergency contact info

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.666 size:88% position:44% line:92%
before you come inside."

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.369 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It's for your safety.

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Next, it's Sears.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:13.206
Their slogan is, "It's the most
crowded day of the year.

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:14.274 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Six customers."

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:15.575 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh. Really?

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Six.
-Six people.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.279 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Six customers.

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:21.114 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Next up, it's Costco.

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:24.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
Their slogan is,
"Where WWE meets 'Hoarders.'"

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.886 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:29.422
-"Honey, quick, get that."
-"Quick, quick, get it."

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:32.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"It's a 100-pack
of paper towels."

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:33.793 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.295 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Next is Kay Jewelers.

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:38.798
Their slogan is, "Every kick
in the groin begins with Kay."

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.300 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And finally,
there's RadioShack.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
Their slogan is,
"You're not too late.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
Our shelves are always
this empty."

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.574 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:48.708 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Good luck out there.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.144
Of course, tomorrow is the
Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I heard it could be
one of the --

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:55.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
You guys are going?

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:56.316 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'll be there.

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:59.919
I heard it could be one of
the coldest parades in decades.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
Check out what some
of the balloons had to say

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:03.389 line:92%
about the freezing temperatures.

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:04.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
First up,
the Pillsbury Doughboy said,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don't know why I thought
this kerchief

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.328 line:92%
was enough to keep me warm."

00:02:08.328 --> 00:02:09.762 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:12.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then Charlie Brown said,
"It's times like this

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:14.968
when I wish I had more
than one strand of hair."

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:15.802 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
Chase from "PAW Patrol" said,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.940
"I peed on a fire hydrant
and got stuck there for hours."

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh!
-Yeah.

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:24.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-You can't do it.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.378 line:92%
You guys hear about this?

00:02:25.378 --> 00:02:26.513 line:92%
Health officials want everyone

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:28.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
to throw away
their romaine lettuce

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.383 line:92%
because it might have E. coli.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:33.753
In response, iceberg lettuce
was like, "Well, well, well.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.922 line:92%
Look who came crawling back.

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:36.890 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:39.759 line:92%
Oh, the old romaine people."

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:40.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:42.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of course, Donald Trump's
always in the news.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sometimes he says some
pretty questionable things.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:46.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
And while we can't filter
what he says,

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
we can filter how he looks
when he says it.

00:02:48.368 --> 00:02:51.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll show you what I mean.
It's time for "Trump Filters."

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:52.238 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Here we go.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:55.041 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.043 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-How dark is your mode?

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:59.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's very light,
and I will tell you

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:01.614 size:78% position:39%
[High-pitched voice]
I'm extremely upbeat.

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:04.918
The White house is running
like a well-oiled machine.

00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:07.253 size:84% position:42%
It's going really well.
I have great people.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:10.056
[ Normal voice ] I will make
some changes but not very many.

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:13.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:18.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys, we're all affected
by what goes on in the news.

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:21.401
Sometimes we can feel totally
different about a news story

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:22.669 line:92%
