00:03:22.669 --> 00:03:23.736 line:92%
Here, I'll show you what I mean.

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's time for
"Before and After."

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:28.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here we go.
-♪♪ "Before and After" ♪♪

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:31.544 size:88% position:44% line:92%
♪♪ "Before and After" ♪♪

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:32.445 line:92%
-So I'll read a news story

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:35.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
