00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:09.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
And here we are after hearing
we shouldn't eat salad.

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:10.416 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:12.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally tonight,
